{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】本台早前揭發有「白牌車」接載內地旅客離港，警方連日發起打擊及拘捕行動。究竟跨境「白牌車」為何禁之不絕？怎樣才是長遠的治本方案？</p>\n<p>周二《時事全方位》，請來嘉賓討論 。</p>\n<p>題目：跨境白牌車問題</p>\n<p>熱線電話：1833298</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:01:06.085133+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:55:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:26.264856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:58:57.844918+00:00","content_hash":"bacb305f0de40a95a817d23456a46373e2576a17a8119aa8c863c238af4a18e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}